  user_1,[00:00] Hey Sunita uh I got your email about the claim paperwork
  user_2,[00:05] Hi Samar! Yes I sent the checklist Did you get a chance to look at it
  user_1,[00:10] Yeah I think I’m missing something about the proof of payment Do I need the original receipt or a copy works
  user_2,[00:15] Good question a clear scanned copy is fine as long as the total amount and date are visible
  user_1,[00:20] Got it Also I’m wondering if I can submit everything through the portal or do I have to mail paper copies
  user_2,[00:25] You can upload everything in the portal We have a Claims Upload section It’s pretty straightforward
  user_1,[00:30] Okay and the portal does it accept photos of the cabinets I have a few high‑res shots
  user_2,[00:35] Absolutely just make sure the photos are under 5 MB each The system will compress if needed
  user_1,[00:40] Great One more thing I noticed the premium was reduced after the discount When will the next billing cycle be
  user_2,[00:45] Your next premium due date is 15 Oct 2026 Since the policy is active now the first payment will be auto‑debit on that date
  user_1,[00:50] Perfect thanks I’ll get the docs together and upload them today
  user_2,[00:55] Sounds good Samar If anything else comes up just give us a call or drop a message Have a good day
  user_1,[01:00] Thanks you too Bye